rill and excitement of \u201cNinja Warrior\u201d come alive in VR!\nUse every bit of your strength, balance, and reflexes to conquer intense obstacle courses through full-body motion."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "\u6a2a\u9577\u30ab\u30cf\u3099\u30fc_2560\u00d71440px.png", "id": "4206557512967114", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619098_4206557516300447_943281957663249977_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hdETlbTmxjcQ7kNvwELWUjt&_nc_oc=AdotxfWmhdT7kPBHjankaRUC0ufhJa16nndnoWkOObj6cKanl9iAuD-AnHkTM4CHPfk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSy212PlHNywb_eoul6S7aFOAbBV4Qucgucd-4pFm8mhA&oe=6B0455AF"}, {"file_name": "\u30d2\u30fc\u30ed\u30fc\u30ab\u30cf\u3099\u30fc_3000\u00d7900px.png", "id": "2975615619303809", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619774_2975615622637142_1331376706207959328_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YRw5N8dZvjkQ7kNvwHFVqVV&_nc_oc=AdqK0jt8adcWWKaY06fPGlDxdFYJZslMY9lecHOl7EroTRBAJRx_aeAErkq12lknIQI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQQm1g3o-Fm19tkUXUOoIY5oSVwinGegV1qZGcLNHPOvA&oe=6B04679A"}, {"file_name": "\u7e26\u9577\u306e\u30ab\u30cf\u3099\u30fc_1008\u00d71440px.png", "id": "1459347908497843", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619096_1459347911831176_5240984296618367253_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Itg0ZxIN6AgQ7kNvwG5h1R6&_nc_oc=AdonekrhrcqicJRMCXUN8z54WY4JhvXgBP6UUZpqx82vqS2O0S0bainisS7um7gF4Bw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTggiSTprI6CGvKNG2iFj35CtsUiFHzLVyJ6_VN4MaquA&oe=6B0484FC"}, {"file_name": "\u30a2\u30a4\u30b3\u30f3_512\u00d7512px.png", "id": "1182588407080721", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scon